# Arabic translations for SupportOS's own custom backend messages.
#
# DRF's and Django's own messages (NotFound, PermissionDenied, etc.) already
# ship pre-compiled Arabic .mo files and need no entry here — see
# CONVENTIONS.md §18. This catalogue covers only the two custom strings in
# apps/core/exceptions.py.
#
# NOTE: GNU gettext (msgfmt) was not available on the machine that authored
# this file, so it has not been compiled to django.mo. Run
# `python manage.py compilemessages` once gettext is installed; until then
# these two messages fall back to their English msgid.
